[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10202.55, "timestamp": "02:50:02", "text": "你跟我讲过那些事吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10204.469, "timestamp": "02:50:04", "text": "是我吧？当我发帖的时候，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10206.23, "timestamp": "02:50:06", "text": "像印度第一位 YouTuber 那样的视频"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10208.15, "timestamp": "02:50:08", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10211.19, "timestamp": "02:50:11", "text": "是的。我和那家伙聊了一会儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10214.79, "timestamp": "02:50:14", "text": "实际上，那东西就是这么说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10217.91, "timestamp": "02:50:17", "text": "就像，呃，在我发布了一些视频之后，他又来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10221.83, "timestamp": "02:50:21", "text": "显然有所改变。他变化很大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10224.87, "timestamp": "02:50:24", "text": "哪个在哪？嗯，对，就是你这家伙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10227.99, "timestamp": "02:50:27", "text": "我知道我跟你说过那个喜欢……的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10229.83, "timestamp": "02:50:29", "text": "谁告诉我，那里人很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10232.07, "timestamp": "02:50:32", "text": "在这里你不能说他们是这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10233.67, "timestamp": "02:50:33", "text": "你已经这么做了，但你不能再用那些东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10236.07, "timestamp": "02:50:36", "text": "视频里，他给了我一些提示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10237.75, "timestamp": "02:50:37", "text": "他给了我证据之类的东西，我当时真是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10241.429, "timestamp": "02:50:41", "text": "很恼火，呃，就像我知道我正在做的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10244.309, "timestamp": "02:50:44", "text": "因为我看到了一个视频，所以就发了这个视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10248.63, "timestamp": "02:50:48", "text": "总之，呃，但他说了也做了，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10251.349, "timestamp": "02:50:51", "text": "那是另一回事，但他现在相当不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10253.75, "timestamp": "02:50:53", "text": "他说话很有礼貌，而且他很会照顾人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10256.309, "timestamp": "02:50:56", "text": "一切都很好。那很好。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10258.95, "timestamp": "02:50:58", "text": "取得了一些进展。"}]